# Locally-uploaded media. Never commit these - and note they are NOT part of the
# deploy artifact either, so they need their own volume + backup. See ADR 0008.
#
# LEADING SLASH IS REQUIRED. `uploads/` (unanchored) matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded the entire
# `src/modules/uploads/
/uploads-test/` source directory - new files there were skipped by
# `git add` without any warning.
/uploads/
/uploads-test/
